1
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,117
There you go. All done.

2
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,417
You're the best, Liz.

3
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,330
Thanks.

4
00:00:23,413 --> 00:00:24,243
Sure. Anytime.

5
00:00:24,326 --> 00:00:26,217
Hey, aren't you supposed to be
out hunting with the guild today?

6
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,130
Hmm. Yeah,

7
00:00:27,213 --> 00:00:30,897
I had to take the day off cuz I sort of
have the same little meeting with someone,

8
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:31,810
oh!

9
00:00:31,893 --> 00:00:37,297
I bet you have a little me, no?

10
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:38,417
it's not like that.

11
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:42,257
I have to get going.

12
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:49,057
I bet he must be pretty
special whoever he is, huh?

13
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:50,577
did you say something?

14
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:52,917
Get going!

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,697
It's rude to keep your date waiting.

16
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:55,760
It's not like

17
