I wonder if I'll ever
find someone special.

18
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:58,037
but I'll be in love with a heart.

19
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:02,220
In my dreams I can't breathe.

20
00:02:05,340 --> 00:02:08,164
When I'm on the body,
I'll be able to get rid of

21
00:02:15,020 --> 00:02:17,577
This makes me feel like a weak person.

22
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:34,217
I wanna always be with you!

23
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:37,080
I'm giving everything I have.

24
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,760
Good enough, I guess.

25
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:04,576
I better get ready for the customers.

26
00:03:08,060 --> 00:03:08,890
Perfect.

27
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:15,180
Welcome to Lizbeth's blacksmith shop.

28
00:03:16,820 --> 00:03:17,650
Oh, hi.

29
00:03:18,060 --> 00:03:20,648
Uh, I was wondering if
you do custom orders.

30
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:25,470
Hmm.

31
00:03:25,553 --> 00:03:27,628
He doesn't look like
he has that much money.

32
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,070
I can.

33
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:32,177
The thing is, metal prices
are kinda high these days.

34
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:34,597
Oh, well, I'm not worried about the cost.

35
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:37,457
I just want the best sword you
can make as soon as possible.

36
00:03:37,540 --> 00:03:39,477
Well, I make a lot of different swords,

37
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:42,997
but if you have any idea of the quality
of swords you want, I can make it.

38
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,400
Uh, sure. One sec.

39
00:03:45,060 --> 00:03:49,520
So, I'm looking for something either
the same quality, or better than this.

40
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:54,660
An elucidator!

41
