68
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:22,477
That sounds like the kind
of sword I'm looking for.

69
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:24,797
As long as it can shatter mine, though.

70
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:28,477
Okay, smarty pants, but you have to
help me make it every step of the way.

71
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,390
