Fine, just keep quiet
and stay out of the way.

88
00:06:12,460 --> 00:06:13,757
Keep quiet and...

89
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:15,546
By the way, my name's Kirito.

90
00:06:15,740 --> 00:06:17,997
Looks like we're a party
until we make that sword.

91
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:19,580
Yeah, whatever, Kirito.

92
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:23,035
Well, if you're gonna be like
that, I can roll with it.

93
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,510
Liz-bet.

94
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:34,870
Hatsi!

95
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:36,790
It's cold.

96
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:39,797
Well, you should have
brought a coat or something.

97
00:06:39,880 --> 00:06:43,292
I didn't know Floor 55 was
going to be this freaking cold.

98
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:49,995
Are you going to be okay without this?

99
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:52,631
You don't feel cold if you're disciplined.

100
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:55,546
If you're trying to piss
me off, it's working.

101
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:58,480
It's warm, though.

102
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:03,318
I can't believe I'm out here
all alone with this guy.

103
00:07:03,940 --> 00:07:05,360
