107
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:14,477
And if you're gonna be a jerk about
it, you might as well call me Liz.

108
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,390
Okay, okay.

109
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:16,460
Got it, Liz.

110
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,565
Yeah, well, don't wear it out!

111
00:07:31,260 --> 00:07:32,220
It's beautiful!

112
00:07:36,460 --> 00:07:37,636
