skinny sword, who is he?

128
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:59,137
Come on, stop playing with
it and finish it up already!

129
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:00,050
Damn it!

130
00:09:00,133 --> 00:09:00,963
Don't come out yet!

131
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:03,790
What?

132
00:09:03,873 --> 00:09:04,703
What's the big deal?

133
00:09:04,786 --> 00:09:06,242
You've got it right where you...

134
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:09,710
Liz!

135
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,340
Hang on to me, Liz!

136
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:45,837
are we still alive yeah it looks like

137
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:50,520
it drink one of these just in case

138
00:10:03,180 --> 00:10:05,097
Thank you, Eno, for...

139
00:10:05,180 --> 00:10:08,517
for saving me It's a little
early to be thanking anyone.

140
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,857
We have to find a way to
get out of here first.

141
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:11,770
Huh?

142
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:13,468
Can't we just teleport out?

143
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,720
Teleport Lindis!

144
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:19,840
No way!

145
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:24,417
Well, if we can't use crystals, that
means there should be another way out.

146
00:10:24,500 --> 00:10:26,297
