147
00:10:26,380 --> 00:10:30,317
I mean, maybe this is some kind of trap
rig to kill anyone who falls into it.

148
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:31,230
Good point.

149
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,200
Maybe it is.

150
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:36,840
